  "decision": "Approved",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 03 October 2025, the proposed use of Room G31E West Link House 981 Great West Road, as a private hire operator's office, is lawful within the meaning of Section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 for the following reasons:\r\n\r\nThe private vehicle hire business within the property would not have public access. No external alterations are proposed.  There would be no picking up or dropping off customers at the site, nor would there be the comings and goings of drivers to the premises. The nature of Room G31E and the scale of the business use would not constitute a material change of use outside permitted development of part or whole of the building, and therefore, planning permission is not required.\r\n"
  ],
